      "description": "Flat container with a tinted head.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-head\"><h2>Request volume</h2><span class=\"ds-evidence\"><i></i>Observed</span></div><div class=\"ds-panel-body\">Requests grouped by traffic class.</div></section>",
